{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》熱播掀起全城熱話，劇中飾演經理人藍鳳儀及現年46歲姚子羚意外成為網絡焦點。近日有網民驚 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》熱播掀起全城熱話，劇中飾演經理人藍鳳儀及現年46歲姚子羚意外成為網絡焦點。近日有網民驚覺經典劇集《真情》靈魂人物好姨當年加入劇組時竟與現時姚子羚同齡，強烈視覺反差瞬間觸發公眾瘋狂討論。這股跨越30年演藝圈審美變遷風暴更直接引出本尊親自下場爆出驚人語錄。</p>\n<h2>網民翻出薛家燕拍攝《真情》時僅得46歲</h2>\n<p>11月16日社交平台爆發一陣熱議，貼文明確指出當年薛家燕於1996年加入劇組飾演羅霖母親時原來僅得46歲。當時她無論造型與神態都極具說服力，完美演繹出市井味濃及師奶氣質，令觀眾毫不質疑。反觀現年同樣46歲及保養得宜並於台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中展現型格氣場的姚子羚，目前正處於巔峰狀態，實在難以將她與昔日經典角色聯想在一起。網民更笑言現年76歲家燕姐如今容光煥發，看起來甚至比當年拍劇時更具活力，紛紛大嘆現代保養技術驚人。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948214267118387_7757730686afacd332fd5a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948214267118387_7757730686afacd332fd5a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>姚子羚本尊高情商回應大方表示願意挑戰角色</h2>\n<p>這股網絡熱議意外釣出當事人本尊親自留言回應，為整個事件增添戲劇性。近期在《玫瑰戰爭》中周旋於陳豪與陳自瑤之間及演技大獲好評並展現專業態度的姚子羚，面對網上排山倒海對比圖及討論，她大方笑稱：「如果《真情》翻拍，我都可以做好姨！」這番破格及充滿自信發言瞬間獲大批網民激讚。面對跨年代角色對比，她未有展現任何抗拒心理，反而展現出成熟演員應有專業素養與寬廣胸襟。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482142776455919_11131347376afacd342ef1b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-9\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482142776455919_11131347376afacd342ef1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民翻出李司棋拍攝《溏心風暴》真實年紀</h2>\n<p>隨着話題持續發酵，不少人更翻出多位經典角色真實拍劇年齡作對比，結果同樣令人咋舌。當中以大契一角深入民心及展現強強對決氣場，網民發現李司棋在2007年拍攝《溏心風暴》時其實只有56歲，正與現時宣萱同齡。進一步考究下，司棋姐在1995年開拍《真情》時更僅得45歲，與現時同演《玫瑰戰爭》並引發熱議陳自瑤年紀相若。一連串數字對比將過往與現今花旦年齡層及外貌特徵攤開比較。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482142839555792_7494431966afacd3594583.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"20250116112813_68fd8049692b60f7a91157568d63f9f1c905468e.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482142839555792_7494431966afacd3594583.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>李司棋在2007年拍攝《溏心風暴》時其實只有56歲（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《玫瑰戰爭》掀起審美變遷觸發網民瘋狂留言</h2>\n<p>網上輿論針對這項驚人發現呈現兩極化熱烈討論，不少觀眾紛紛湧入社交平台表達震撼之情。大批網民留言表示「完全想像唔到子羚同好姨係同一個年紀」、「而家啲女星真係好識保養」，對現今藝人凍齡外貌感到不可思議。亦有資深電視迷提出獨特見解，留言指「以前啲劇本要演員演老角，依家40幾歲仲可以演後生女」，直指過去30年演藝圈審美與藝人保養觀念發生巨大變遷。這場由兩代花旦引發視覺衝擊，持續在各大社交平台引發大量留言。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482143021484695_12787200086afacd36ac9b5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482143021484695_12787200086afacd36ac9b5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482143129286807_6424532176afacd3798898.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-3\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482143129286807_6424532176afacd3798898.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a7%9a%e5%ad%90%e7%be%9a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">姚子羚</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%ab%e7%91%b0%e6%88%b0%e7%88%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">玫瑰戰爭</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%96%9b%e5%ae%b6%e7%87%95/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">薛家燕</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544063\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.138913+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1449,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:30:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:46.957524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:46.957524+00:00","content_hash":"d82ca944eb409f085859a519b64f840b499f5fc866163d962243d1f6da422629","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}